From 124237ce35282c75aeba33133aa1ec6eb63889b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Brue <ryanbrue.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 14:08:01 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: iio: adc: mediatek,mt6359-auxadc: add the MT6397
 AUXADC

The MT6397 PMIC has an auxiliary ADC of the same shape as the MT6350 series
parts already described here: a channel-select and start register, a
per-channel result register with a ready bit, and nothing else to describe
in the device tree beyond the compatible and #io-channel-cells. The MFD
binding for the MT6397 already accepts an "adc" child that references this
schema, so only the compatible needs adding.

The MT6397 AUXADC is 10 bits wide and measures the battery voltage and the
battery thermistor on tablets built around this PMIC, which is what the
mt6397-auxadc driver exposes.

Signed-off-by: Ryan Brue <ryanbrue.dev@gmail.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/mediatek,mt6359-auxadc.yaml  | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/mediatek,mt6359-auxadc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/mediatek,mt6359-auxadc.yaml
index 9936aa605..eaacef1d7 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/mediatek,mt6359-auxadc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/mediatek,mt6359-auxadc.yaml
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 $id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/iio/adc/mediatek,mt6359-auxadc.yaml#
 $schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
 
-title: MediaTek MT6350 series PMIC AUXADC
+title: MediaTek MT6350 series and MT6397 PMIC AUXADC
 
 maintainers:
   - AngeloGioacchino Del Regno <angelogioacchino.delregno@collabora.com>
@@ -15,6 +15,8 @@ description:
   such as battery and PMIC internal voltage regulators temperatures,
   accessory detection resistance (usually, for a 3.5mm audio jack)
   other than voltages for various PMIC internal components.
+  The older MT6397 has a 10-bit AUXADC of the same shape, measuring the
+  battery voltage and the battery thermistor.
 
 properties:
   compatible:
@@ -23,6 +25,7 @@ properties:
           - mediatek,mt6357-auxadc
           - mediatek,mt6358-auxadc
           - mediatek,mt6359-auxadc
+          - mediatek,mt6397-auxadc
           - mediatek,mt6363-auxadc
           - mediatek,mt6373-auxadc
       - items:
